# Developer Onboarding Report
## AU DIC v1.0.0 — Phase 4 Setup & Onboarding Audit

**Audited:** 2026-07-30  
**Scope:** Local Development Setup, First Launch Experience, Dependency Management

---

## 1. Onboarding Flow Evaluation

```
[ Clone Repository ] ---> [ Copy .env.example ] ---> [ npm run install-all ] ---> [ npm run seed ] ---> [ Start Servers ]
```

| Step | Smoothness | Time Estimate | Verdict | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| **Prerequisites** | High | 5 mins | ✅ PASS | Node.js v20+, MongoDB, Firebase credentials required. |
| **Dependencies** | High | 2 mins | ✅ PASS | Root `package.json` installs frontend dependencies; backend handles microservice deps. |
| **Environment Config** | Medium | 3 mins | ✅ PASS | Clear `.env.example` templates provided in root and `/backend`. |
| **Database Seeding** | High | 1 min | ✅ PASS | `npm run seed` initializes orgs, roles, permissions, and test accounts. |
| **Server Startup** | High | 1 min | ✅ PASS | Concurrent execution via `./start-dev.ps1` or separate terminal tabs. |

